  m_text: "Toxin waste slows the character.\nIt can reduce walking speed, jump height,
    and dash speed.\n\nIf the character touches the liquid, it will <b>pull them
    in</b> and deal <b>damage over time</b>.\n\n<b>Note:</b> Toxins can appear anywhere\u2014even
    on walls or ceilings."
